# Bug Report 2

## Title 
Generated dates overlap and render incorrectly after high-volume generated in Firefox 

## Environment
- Browser: Mozilla Firefox (Latest) 
- OS: Windows
- URL: https://codebeautify.org/generate-random-date

## Severity
Medium 

## Priority 
Low

## Steps to Reproduce 
1. Open the Random Date Generater tool in Firefox.
2. Enter "1,000,000" in the " How many dates to generate?" field.
3. Click "Generate"
4. Scroll through the generated results.

## Expected Result
The generated dates should display clearly with consistent formatting.

## Actual Result 
The dates apperar bolded and visually overlaped, The layout becomes distorted after large-volume generated.
